    summary: "‘US backs off from Iran before markets open on weekdays’",
    preview: "‘US backs off from Iran before markets open on weekdays’ US President Donald Trump says new talks with Iran will begin on Monday after he called off a planned ‘massive attack’. Analyst Negar Mortazavi describes what’s become a pattern where talks of a breakthrough often come just before financial markets open after a weekend.",
